        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: The Scarlet Letter (1995 film)\n- People: Roland Joffé, Demi Moore, Gary Oldman, Robert Duvall\n- Companies: Cinergi Pictures\n\nFacts:\n- Gary Oldman was born on 21 March 1958 and is an English actor, filmmaker, musician, and author who has worked in theatre, film, and television.\n- The Scarlet Letter is a 1995 American romantic drama film.\n- The 1995 film The Scarlet Letter was directed by Roland Joffé and stars Demi Moore, Gary Oldman, and Robert Duvall.\n- Cinergi Pictures suffered a string of box office bombs that included The Scarlet Letter, and the company closed in 1998.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
